WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.376
People have been building boats

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.502
to try to go underwater

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.962
for a very long time.

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.504
Like, look at this

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.588
old art where you can see

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:06.881
Alexander the Great going

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.049
completely underwater

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:09.467
in a big glass barrel.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:10.677
This is like 2000 years ago.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:11.886
1800 years later,

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:13.179
you have Leonardo da Vinci,

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:13.888
who was busy

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.932
literally thinking of anything

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:17.017
that could be invented,

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.768
and he sketched up his very own version

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:19.978
of an underwater boat.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.312
This beauty right here

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:22.063
It was basically like

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:23.398
a big mechanical fish.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.149
Oh, and

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:24.858
– this is wild –

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.526
He kept these sketches a secret

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.986
because he feared,

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.701
Like, he thought that

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.119
we might use these underwater

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:37.829
boats for war.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:39.706
Whoops!

